^{:go/end 151} (go/method varType "varType type-checks the type expression e and returns its type, or Typ[Invalid].\nThe type must not be an (uninstantiated) generic type and it must not be a\nconstraint interface.\n" ^Type [^{:tag (* Checker)} check ^syntax/Expr e]
