^{:go/end 393} (go/method typInternal "typInternal drives type checking of types.\nMust only be called by declaredType or genericType.\n" [^{:tag (* Checker)} check ^syntax/Expr e0 ^{:tag (* TypeName)} def] :results [^Type T]
